## Future Progress and Roadmap

This project has strong potential for expansion beyond the initial EDA. Future work could include:

### 1. Advanced Analysis
- Customer segmentation using RFM analysis
- Clustering of shopping behavior patterns
- Correlation analysis across more variables

### 2. Predictive Modeling
- Predicting purchase amount or purchase likelihood
- Classifying high-value customers
- Forecasting product demand by season

### 3. Dashboard Development
- Building an interactive dashboard with Streamlit or Dash
- Allowing stakeholders to explore the dataset visually
- Creating business-friendly KPI summaries

### 4. Business Applications
- Identifying the best products to promote
- Suggesting seasonal marketing campaigns
- Improving inventory planning and pricing strategies
- Improving customer retention strategies through segmentation

### 5. Deployment and Reporting
- Automating report generation
- Sharing analysis through notebooks or a dashboard
- Making the project suitable for portfolio presentation or business use cases

