## How to Use This Repository

1. Clone the repository.
2. Open the notebook in Jupyter.
3. Run the cells in order to reproduce the analysis.
4. Modify the visualizations or aggregate metrics to explore your own questions.
5. Use the insights as a foundation for more advanced business or machine learning analysis.

